## Anonymous Inbox — English. Shared keys (buttons, VIP, admin…) come from core/locales.
anon-home =
    👋 Hi <b>{ $name }</b>! This is your <b>anonymous inbox</b>.

    🔗 Your link:
    <code>{ $link }</code>

    Share it in your story, bio or group chats — anyone who opens it can send you a message
    <b>without revealing who they are</b>. You can reply, and they stay anonymous. 👀

    📬 Received: <b>{ $received }</b> (this week: { $week })
anon-owner-home =
    👋 Hi <b>{ $name }</b>! This bot is your <b>anonymous inbox</b>.

    🔗 Share this link: <code>{ $link }</code>

    Everyone who writes to this bot reaches you anonymously, and you can reply right here.

    📬 Received: <b>{ $received }</b> (this week: { $week })
anon-help =
    ℹ️ <b>How it works</b>

    1. /link — get your personal link and a story card.
    2. Share it. People open it and write to you anonymously.
    3. Tap ↩️ <b>Reply</b> under any message to answer — they stay anonymous, you don't.
    4. 🚫 Block or ⚠️ report anyone who's mean. Nobody ever sees who blocked or reported them.
anon-write-prompt =
    ✍️ Write your anonymous message to <b>{ $name }</b>.

    Text, photo, video, voice, sticker — anything. They will <b>never</b> know it was you. 🤫
anon-reply-prompt = ↩️ Write your reply — send any message.
anon-cancelled = ✖️ Cancelled.
anon-sent = ✅ <b>Sent anonymously!</b> 🤫
anon-not-delivered = 😕 Couldn't deliver it — the person may have stopped the bot. You weren't charged.
anon-new = 📩 <b>New anonymous message</b>
anon-reply-anonymous = 💬 <b>Anonymous reply</b> to your message:
anon-reply-from-owner = 💬 <b>{ $name }</b> replied to your anonymous message:
