anon-own-link = 😄 That's your own link! Share it with friends so they can write to you.
anon-inbox-paused = ⏸ This inbox isn't accepting messages right now.
anon-cant-send = 🚫 You can't send messages to this inbox.
anon-not-yours = This message isn't yours.
anon-unsupported = 🙈 This kind of message can't be sent. Try text, a photo, a video or a voice note.
anon-filtered = 🛑 That message looks hurtful, so it wasn't sent. Keep it kind 💛
